{"height": 10, "weight": 180, "base_experience": 161, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "speed", "value": 2}], "genus": "Hostile Pokémon", "capture_rate": 25, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 40, "growth_rate": "medium", "egg_groups": ["water2"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "バスラオ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Bassrao"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "배쓰나이"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "野蠻鱸魚"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Bargantua"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Barschuft"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Basculin"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Basculin"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "バスラオ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "野蛮鲈鱼"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Basculin"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["black"], "text": "Red and blue Basculin get along so poorly, they’ll start fighting instantly. These Pokémon are very hostile."}, {"versions": ["white", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other’s school."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "Red- and blue-striped Basculin are very violent and always fighting. They are also remarkably tasty."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "Savage, violent Pokémon, red and blue Basculin are always fighting each other over territory."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "When a school of Basculin appears in a lake, everything else disappears, except for Corphish and Crawdaunt. That’s how violent Basculin are."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "Anglers love the fight this Pokémon puts up on the hook. And there are always more to catch— many people release them into lakes illicitly."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "In the past, it often appeared on the dinner table. The meat of red-striped Basculin is on the fatty side, and it’s more popular with the youth."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, i